title Cassette state (PLAY/PAUSE key, hubs, meter): idle: PLAY not latched, the hubs still, the live INPUT level on the meter
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_ANIM_TICKS 2
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot state-idle
expect text "PLAY"
expect notext "PAUSE"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
